    "title": "Home Buying Help for Northern Colorado Teachers | The Little Lady Sells Homes",
    "description": "Are you a Northern Colorado teacher struggling to afford a home? The Little Lady Sells Homes offers $1000 to teacher clients to help with closing costs or down payments. Check out our comprehensive list of teacher salary schedules and learn how to buy a home with nothing down. Contact us at 303-709-4262.",
